        "action_date": "2025-05-21",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Veteran Wildland Firefighter Employment Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Veterans Affairs, Department of Agriculture, and Department of the Interior to jointly establish a two-year pilot program to employ veterans in&nbsp;wildland firefighting activities.</p>",
